        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish setup": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminar la configuración"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fix %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corregir %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conceder…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold one finger still, then move the mouse to drag — no first tap, so text and small handles stay precise. Grip the mouse from the sides and keep the top surface clear except when tapping or dragging: a finger left resting on the shell starts a drag, and clicking the mouse won’t register until it lifts.": {
      "comment": "Explainer under the Drag style picker for the press-and-hold option.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén un dedo quieto y luego mueve el ratón para arrastrar: sin toque previo, así el texto y los tiradores pequeños se mantienen precisos. Sujeta el ratón por los lados y deja libre la superficie superior salvo al tocar o arrastrar: un dedo apoyado en la carcasa inicia un arrastre, y el clic del ratón no se registrará hasta que lo levantes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold threshold": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umbral de mantenimiento"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homepage": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Página web"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ignore taps during a physical click": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignorar los toques durante un clic físico"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import MagicButtons Settings": {
      "comment": "Open-panel title. 'MagicButtons' is the app name — do not translate.",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importar los ajustes de MagicButtons"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importar…"
          }
        }
      }
